Phase Description <code>Pending</code> The syncer has not yet made the DataVolume <code>Syncing</code> The CDI DataVolume is importing the image <code>Ready</code> The DataVolume phase is <code>Succeeded</code> and the Template has been created <code>Failed</code> An error occurred (check <code>message</code> for details) <p>If a golden image shows <code>Failed</code>, check the DataVolume:</p> <pre><code>oc get dv -n ${TUTORIAL_NS}
oc describe dv golden-centos-stream9-image-cron -n ${TUTORIAL_NS}
</code></pre> <p>To retry, delete the DataVolume. The syncer makes a new one on the next cycle. If the message says the DataVolume "was not made by pool", a DataVolume with the same name already exists that the pool did not make. Delete it, or use a different name.</p>
